{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Do not swallow JVM-fatal continuation failures.** Catching every `Throwable` converts `VirtualMachineError` and `ThreadDeath` into an observation-future failure; wait-for-condition continuation chains do not observe that future, so the fatal can disappear and the execution may suspend/replay. Settle the future first, then rethrow JVM-fatal failures from the coordinator worker.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77qqDc","finding_digest":"03e3dab64ed1cd09a776a4407e6e5b0e2c6f74d20999234577c117a7b9ad21ea","finding_id":"arf_v1_apr5vnso2hgqtj3wurah43s3by","finding_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::completecheckpointcontinuation::jvm-fatal-swallowing","identity_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::completecheckpointcontinuation::jvm-fatal-swallowing","line":599,"observation_digest":"54e1f04ba74a6f7becb2513e1e7bf4d7439895ff95b927bf1640f2cf9c5cc2d2","observation_id":"aro_v1_ktq7as5hjjxxx3fske7b467u25","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManager.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-08T17:41:38Z","review_id":"arr_v1_w4f4vfmlkvk6yuwzqbo6rmxwrf","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"6c590162ee0e40cbba600285b7fafbadc0457c8e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":599,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_ecyr5vegg73f52tsbpnk6rxhjx","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T17:41:38Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
